-<!-- CARROT:REVIEW reviewed-for="" -->
+<!-- CARROT:REVIEW reviewed-for="41cef2694ada9a420b24595193766ac4c44cb8ea48a3b141fa8a4fc74c6abffc" reviewed-at="2026-10-29T09:00:00Z" -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+Common base following time for the selected GAP level. The planner’s applied time, including speed, driving-mode and braking adjustments, also drives Porter button deceleration and optional low-target cancellation.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Usage
+
+Adjust common TF1–TF4 in one place. Legacy Porter-only values are neither used nor copied into the common settings.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN REFERENCE -->
+### Reference
+
+Without a fresh valid planner time, use the selected common base setting. The existing 7m distance floor and button/cancel bounds remain; actual following distance, braking or stopping is not guaranteed.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END REFERENCE -->
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:END TFollowGap1 -->
 
